hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1736","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jo tumhey bayan karey ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us mein se kuchh chhupaaya jo Allah ne Aap par naazil kya to us ne jhoot kaha. Jabke Allah farmaata hai: (Ae Rasool! Pahunchaao jo tumhaari taraf tumharey Rab se naazil hua) aayat. (Bukhari: 4612). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Umdah cheezein haraam na karaar do jo Allah ne tumhaarey liye halaal kein)."
"1737","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwa kartey they jabke hamaarey sath auratein na theen. To ham ne kaha: Kya ham khassi na ho jaaein? To Aap ne hamein us se mana kya. Phir Aap ne hamein uskey baad rukhsat di ke ham aurat se kapdey key badley nikaah karein. Phir Aap ne padha: (Ae imaan walon! Umdah cheezein haraam na karaar do jo Allah ne tumhaarey liye halaal kein). (Bukhari: 4615). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Beshak sharaab aur juwa aur but aur teer shaitaan key kaam mein se gandagi hain)."
"1738","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamaarey paas tumhaarey is fazeekh key siwa sharaab na thi jise tum fazeekh kehtey ho. To beshak main khada Abu Talha aur fulaan aur fulaan ko pila raha tha ke aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Kya tumhey khabar pahunchi hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo kya hai? Us ne kaha: Sharaab haraam kar di gai hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Anas in gharon ko baha do! Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne uskey baarey mein na poochha aur na uskey baad uski taraf wapas aey. (Bukhari: 4617). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aisi cheezon key baarey mein na poochho jo tum par zaahir ki jaaein to tumhey buri lagein)."
"1739","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khutba diya jo main ne us jaisa kabhi nahi suna. Aap ne farmaya: Kaash tum jaantey jo main jaanta hun to tum thoda hanstey aur bahut rotey. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba ne apne chehrey dhaanp liye jabke unhey rona tha. To aadmi ne kaha: Mera baap kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Fulaan. To ye aayat naazil hui: (Aisi cheezon key baarey mein na poochho jo tum par zaahir ki jaaein to tumhey buri lagein). (Bukhari: 4621)"
"1740","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Qaum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mazaq mein poochhti thi. To aadmi kehta: Mera baap kaun hai? Aur aadmi kehta jiski oontni gum hoti: Meri oontni kahaan hai? To Allah ne unkey baarey mein ye aayat naazil farmai: (Ae imaan walon! Aisi cheezon key baarey mein na poochho jo tum par zaahir ki jaaein to tumhey buri lagein) yahan tak ke poori aayat se faarigh hua. (Bukhari: 4622). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Kaho: Wo qaadir hai ke tum par tumharey upar se azaab bhejey) aayat."
